            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[GainDeck 1.0.0 is the first stable release for Apple Silicon Macs.

If you installed the 1.1.1 preview, 1.0.0 is the stable successor. This release is build 6, an update from preview build 5.

GainDeck analyzes track and album loudness. In Custom Mode, analyze your files before choosing to write or remove ReplayGain tags. ReplayGain playback requires a compatible player with ReplayGain enabled.

Cancelling a scan now shows Cancelled. Engine failures still report their exit code.
]]></description>
